          "id": "258eeb32dd5d49486f3d6b545f5c51a4e8c1ab82",
          "message": "fix: Fix `DISTINCT` with anti/semi joins (#5369)\n\n# Ticket(s) Closed\n\n- Closes #5366\n\n## What\n\nThere were two different issues with `DISTINCT` queries in the join\nscan:\n* anti/semi joins can eliminate columns which the `DISTINCT` was\nexpecting to group on.\n* `ORDER BY` extraction must use a member of the equivalence class which\nwill be present in the output in the context of `DISTINCT`.\n\n## Why\n\nTo improve coverage for the join scan.\n\n## Tests\n\nNew regress test.\n\nA followup will expand property testing to cover these cases.",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-19T13:01:21-07:00",
          "tree_id": "fbca2fee8e29d4e7c3ba916129d558a74e27569b",
