          "message": "ci: Measure recall in Cohere benchmarks (#5393)\n\n# Ticket(s) Closed\n\n- Closes #\n\n## What\n\nMeasures recall, which is important because latencies from different\nvector indexes should be compared at roughly equivalent recall.\n\nRecall requires ground truth data, which has been generated and stored\nin S3 manually since computing it is extremely expensive.\n\nThen, an additional job has been added to our benchmark CLI tool that\nmeasures recall against the ground truth data.\n\n## Why\n\n## How\n\n## Tests",
