          "id": "05b2eed98fb59238f97ea1de175d69a59fffb771",
          "message": "ci: Add Cohere vector benchmarks (#5383)\n\n# Ticket(s) Closed\n\n- Closes #\n\n## What\n\nWorking E2E benchmarks over Cohere 1M/10M, using `pgvector` (both HNSW\nand IVF supported).\n\nNotes:\n\n1. As it turns out we do want a GH workflow for heap snapshot\ngeneration. Snapshots can only be restored if they were generated on the\nsame CPU architecture, so locally generating on an arm64 Mac didn't\nwork. For this reason I factored out a composite action to share between\nbenchmarks and heap snapshot generation.\n2. Some small changes to the CLI tool to support loading from both CSV\nand Parquet (for Cohere).\n\nSee the new GH labels, `benchmark-cohere-ivfflat` and\n`benchmark-cohere-hnsw` to toggle between pgvector indexes.\n\n## Why\n\n## How\n\n## Tests",
